<!-- Developer dev loop — Mermaid diagrams -->

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph LocalDev [Local development machine]
    Dev[Developer] --> IDE[IDE / Editor]
    IDE --> DevServer[Node dev server (npm run dev)]
    IDE --> PyServer[Python myai (uvicorn)]
    IDE --> TestRunner[Vitest (npm run test:fast)]
  end

  Dev -->|commit & push| GitHub[GitHub]
  GitHub -->|open PR| CI[CI (GitHub Actions)]
  CI --> Build[Build: npm ci && npm run build]
  Build --> Lint[ESLint]
  Build --> UnitTests[Unit tests (fast)]
  UnitTests -->|pass| Merge[Merge / Approve]
  Merge --> Deploy[Deploy / Start-full.bat]
  Deploy --> Smoke[Smoke tests (npm run smoke)]
  Smoke --> Monitor[Monitoring & Alerts]

  DevServer -->|hot-reload| IDE
  PyServer -->|background| IDE
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Dev as Developer
  participant IDE as IDE/Local
  participant Node as Node App
  participant Py as Python myai
  participant Git as GitHub
  participant CI as CI Runner

  Dev->>IDE: edit code, add tests
  IDE->>Node: npm run dev (local)
  IDE->>Py: cd myai && uv (local)
  Dev->>Git: git add / commit / push
  Git->>CI: trigger pipeline (PR)
  CI->>Node: build + unit tests
  CI->>Py: run python integration tests
  alt tests pass
    CI-->>Dev: status=green (PR checks passed)
    Dev->>Git: merge
    Git->>CI: deploy workflow
    CI->>Node: start staging/full system
    CI->>Monitor: run smoke checks
  else tests fail
    CI-->>Dev: status=red (failing checks)
  end
```
